=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to Hieronymus.
* Travel to the Beastmen Ensign at (G-12) in {z:Grauberg}.
* Once the party leader has selected to enter, you will be transported into {z:Ruhotz Silvermines}.
* Two parties of {m:Quadavs|Quadav} (4x {m:Quadav Guard}, 1x {m:Quadav Carrier}) will start moving slowly in different directions. The objective of this mission is to kill all 10 {m:Quadavs|Quadav} before they reach the end of their route.
** The Carrier will run off as soon as he's engaged, so you'll need to kill him quickly.
** Should a {m:Carrier|Quadav Carrier} make it to the end of the area, which is quite large, the mission is failed.
* Once all ten {m:Quadavs|Quadav} are defeated, the Mission Objective is complete.
* Must exit area using the Twilight Aureola for {n:Hieronymus} to acknowledge the mission as successful.
* Return and talk to Hieronymus for your reward.

=2 Notes
* Can be cleaved quite comfortably with a reasonably geared BLU.
* Campaign Operation becomes available after completing {p:Pit Spider II (B)}

